OL,3,GNEWSAMan who surveilled police station
OL,4,Ahanded prison sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 35-year-old man who admitted
OL,7,Frecording details of vehicles parked
OL,8,Fwithin Lurgan police station on his
OL,9,Fmobile phone has been given an 18-month
OL,10,Fjail sentence.
OL,12,FSamuel McCaughey from Kilwilkie Road in
OL,13,FLurgan, pleaded guilty in 2024 to
OL,14,F"recording information on 27 May 2020,
OL,15,Flikely to be useful to a person
OL,16,Fcommitting or preparing an act of
OL,17,Fterrorism, namely details of vehicles
OL,18,Fsituated at Lurgan police station".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
